SUMMARY:after work bike ride on the ATT 
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Hiking and Outdoors Group\nWe'll be starting near Sou
 thpoint and final starting point will be sent out Monday evening.\n\nMake 
 sure that your bike is in good working order - tires hold air and are up t
 o pressure\, brakes and shifters work and your chain has been oiled.\n\nWe
 'll be riding just under 2 hours and about 22 miles. The ride is fairly fl
 at and shaded and our pace will be moderate (about 12 mph average). I reco
 mmend a hard tail or hybrid bike\, but if you really want to bring a road 
 bike it's ok\, though you'll likely be a bit bored. Unicycles....?\n\nI'll
  be eating after the ride at a restaurant. You're welcome to join me if yo
 u like.\n\nHelmets are required and by signing up you agree to THOG liabil
 ity waiver statement.\n\nPlease Note!! Any cancellation less than 30 hours
  before the beginning of the event will be considered a "no show"
