SUMMARY:Interest Meeting - Lake Placid/Adirondacks Fall Foliage Trip 2027
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Hiking and Outdoors Group\nAny THOG member interested
  in learning more about this event which will tentatively take place late 
 September 2027 can come to a meeting and Q&A session. After the meeting\, 
 there will be an option to do a short hike at the Park.\nThis trip to Lake
  Placid will be the second trip THOG will have taken to the area except th
 is time the plan is to see the Fall Colors in Lake Placid and the Adironda
 cks as well as do some summit hikes.\n\nWe will meet by the bathrooms at N
 orth Cary Park located at 1100 Norwell Blvd. then walk to the rock wall ne
 arby. We'll talk about the itinerary\, overnight accommodations and logist
 ics of the trip.\nPlease RSVP if you plan to attend this meeting.\n\nThis 
 will be another road trip event. There will be an option to fly in as well
 .\n\nThe event will most likely be posted by November 2026 with RSVP’s o
 pening at that time.\n\nSee you there\,\nLarredo
