SUMMARY:Save The Date! THOG Annual Fall Foliage event- Great Smoky Mountai
 ns
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Hiking and Outdoors Group\nSAVE THE DATE! This year
 ’s Fall Foliage Camping Event will again take place in GSMNP October 16-
 18\, 2026! The OFFICIAL event will be posted this Thursday\, August 20. **
 Please do not RSVP to this save the date announcement.**\n\nRSVP’s will 
 OPEN August 20\, 2026 at 7:00PM. This announcement will be deleted.
